s clears my bar. It's a pragmatic, technically sound infrastructure investment that directly supports Article 12 compliance while reducing friction for individual prototyping teams. The promise score should reflect that it's a solid, implementable solution but not revolutionary - maybe in the 70-80 range. It's good engineering, well-scoped, and addresses real needs without overreaching.\n\nI'll approve with a promise around 75.\n",
