strating systematic compliance infrastructure), and supports institutional survival by ensuring we don't face enforcement action due to documentation gaps. I'd approve this with a high promise score.\n\nMy decision: approve\nPromise: 85 - It's a strong, directly relevant proposal that addresses a real compliance obligation. I'm not at 90+ because it doesn't cover the full Article 12 logging requirement and the \"automatic\" generation raises some QA concerns that would need addressing in implementation, but as a proposal to commit resources to, it's clearly worthwhile from my vantage point.\n",
